#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Small-scale example {#small-scale-example}"
msgstr "Contoh skala kecil {#small-scale-example}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This section walks through each step of the QAOA workflow on a small five-node max-cut instance. Despite the \"small-scale\" label, this example still runs on real IBM Quantum hardware &mdash; the code selects a backend with 127 or more qubits and executes the circuit there.\n"
"Initialize your problem by creating a graph with $n=5$ nodes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bahagian ini menelusuri setiap langkah aliran kerja QAOA pada instans max-cut lima nod yang kecil. Walaupun berlabel \"skala kecil\", contoh ini masih berjalan pada perkakasan IBM Quantum sebenar &mdash; kod ini memilih Backend dengan 127 atau lebih qubit dan melaksanakan Circuit di sana.\n"
"Mulakan masalah anda dengan mencipta graf dengan $n=5$ nod.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm/extracted-outputs/6ced6bea-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm/extracted-outputs/6ced6bea-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Map classical inputs to a quantum problem {#step-1-map-classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"
msgstr "Langkah 1: Petakan input klasik kepada masalah kuantum {#step-1-map-classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Map the classical graph into quantum **circuits** and **operators**. As described in the [Background](#background), for unweighted max-cut the cost Hamiltonian reduces to $H_C = \\sum_{(i,j) \\in E} Z_i Z_j$, and QAOA uses a parametrized ansatz circuit to prepare candidate ground states of $H_C$.\n"
msgstr "Petakan graf klasik kepada **Circuit** dan **operator** kuantum. Seperti yang diterangkan dalam [Latar belakang](#background), untuk max-cut tidak berwajaran Hamiltonian kos berkurang kepada $H_C = \\sum_{(i,j) \\in E} Z_i Z_j$, dan QAOA menggunakan litar ansatz terparameter untuk menyediakan keadaan asas calon bagi $H_C$.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build the cost Hamiltonian {#build-the-cost-hamiltonian}"
msgstr "Bina Hamiltonian kos {#build-the-cost-hamiltonian}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Convert the graph edges into Pauli $Z_iZ_j$ terms to construct $H_C$ (see [Background](#background) for the derivation).\n"
msgstr "Tukarkan tepi graf kepada sebutan Pauli $Z_iZ_j$ untuk membina $H_C$ (lihat [Latar belakang](#background) untuk terbitannya).\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build the QAOA ansatz circuit {#build-the-qaoa-ansatz-circuit}"
msgstr "Bina litar ansatz QAOA {#build-the-qaoa-ansatz-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use `QAOAAnsatz` to construct the parametrized QAOA circuit from the cost Hamiltonian. Here we use `reps=2` (two QAOA layers, four parameters: $\\beta_0, \\beta_1, \\gamma_0, \\gamma_1$).\n"
msgstr "Gunakan `QAOAAnsatz` untuk membina Circuit QAOA terparameter daripada Hamiltonian kos. Di sini kita menggunakan `reps=2` (dua lapisan QAOA, empat parameter: $\\beta_0, \\beta_1, \\gamma_0, \\gamma_1$).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm/extracted-outputs/7bd8c6d4-f40f-4a11-a440-0b26d9021b53-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm/extracted-outputs/7bd8c6d4-f40f-4a11-a440-0b26d9021b53-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Optimize problem for quantum hardware execution {#step-2-optimize-problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"
msgstr "Langkah 2: Optimumkan masalah untuk pelaksanaan perkakasan kuantum {#step-2-optimize-problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile the abstract circuit into hardware-native instructions. This step handles qubit mapping, gate decomposition, routing, and error suppression. See the transpilation [documentation](/guides/transpile) for more information.\n"
msgstr "Transpilkan Circuit abstrak kepada arahan natif perkakasan. Langkah ini mengendalikan pemetaan qubit, penguraian gate, penghalaan, dan penindasan ralat. Lihat [dokumentasi](/guides/transpile) transpilasi untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm/extracted-outputs/3f28a422-805c-4d3d-b5f6-62539e9133bd-1.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm/extracted-outputs/3f28a422-805c-4d3d-b5f6-62539e9133bd-1.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Execute using Qiskit primitives {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-primitives}"
msgstr "Langkah 3: Laksanakan menggunakan primitif Qiskit {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-primitives}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The QAOA optimization loop runs inside a Quantum Compute [session](/guides/execution-modes) to keep the device reserved across iterations. An Estimator evaluates $\\langle H_C \\rangle$ at each step, and a classical optimizer (COBYLA) updates the parameters until convergence.\n"
msgstr "Gelung pengoptimuman QAOA berjalan dalam [session](/guides/execution-modes) Quantum Compute untuk mengekalkan peranti ditempah merentas iterasi. Sebuah Estimator menilai $\\langle H_C \\rangle$ pada setiap langkah, dan pengoptimum klasik (COBYLA) mengemas kini parameter sehingga penumpuan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Illustration showing the behavior of Single job, Batch, and Session runtime modes.](/docs/images/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm/runtime-modes.avif)\n"
"Define initial parameters and run the optimization loop:\n"
msgstr ""
"![Ilustrasi menunjukkan tingkah laku mod jalan Kerja tunggal, Kelompok, dan Sesi.](/docs/images/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm/runtime-modes.avif)\n"
"Takrifkan parameter awal dan jalankan gelung pengoptimuman:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The optimizer was able to reduce the cost and find better parameters for the circuit.\n"
msgstr "Pengoptimum berjaya mengurangkan kos dan mencari parameter yang lebih baik untuk Circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A smoothly decreasing curve that plateaus is the signature of convergence. A noisy, non-monotonic curve usually indicates that something upstream needs attention; common causes are too few shots per evaluation (high estimator variance), poor initial parameters, or a circuit whose depth is dominated by hardware noise. COBYLA is derivative-free and fairly robust to moderate noise, but when the noise swamps the actual cost improvements per step, its linear-approximation model can no longer tell real descent from random jitter and the optimizer wanders.\n"
msgstr "Lengkung yang menurun secara lancar dan mendatar ialah tanda penumpuan. Lengkung yang berbunyi dan tidak monoton biasanya menunjukkan sesuatu di hulu memerlukan perhatian; punca lazim ialah terlalu sedikit shot setiap penilaian (varians estimator tinggi), parameter awal yang lemah, atau Circuit yang kedalamannya dikuasai oleh hingar perkakasan. COBYLA ialah kaedah bebas terbitan dan agak teguh terhadap hingar sederhana, tetapi apabila hingar menenggelamkan peningkatan kos sebenar setiap langkah, model hampiran linearnya tidak lagi dapat membezakan penurunan sebenar daripada getaran rawak dan pengoptimum terkial-kial.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm/extracted-outputs/e14ecc92-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm/extracted-outputs/e14ecc92-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assign the optimized parameters and sample the final distribution using the Sampler primitive.\n"
msgstr "Tetapkan parameter yang dioptimumkan dan ambil sampel taburan akhir menggunakan primitif Sampler.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm/extracted-outputs/2989e76e-4296-4dd8-b065-2b8fced064cf-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm/extracted-outputs/2989e76e-4296-4dd8-b065-2b8fced064cf-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Post-process and return result in desired classical format {#step-4-post-process-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-format}"
msgstr "Langkah 4: Pasca-proses dan kembalikan keputusan dalam format klasik yang dikehendaki {#step-4-post-process-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-format}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Extract the most likely bitstring from the sampled distribution. This represents the best cut found by QAOA.\n"
msgstr "Ekstrak rentetan bit yang paling berkemungkinan daripada taburan yang disampel. Ini mewakili potongan terbaik yang ditemui oleh QAOA.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm/extracted-outputs/650875e9-adbc-43bd-9505-556be2566278-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm/extracted-outputs/650875e9-adbc-43bd-9505-556be2566278-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Visualize best cut {#visualize-best-cut}"
msgstr "Visualkan potongan terbaik {#visualize-best-cut}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "From the optimal bitstring, you can then visualize this cut on the original graph.\n"
msgstr "Daripada rentetan bit optimum, anda kemudian boleh memvisualkan potongan ini pada graf asal.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm/extracted-outputs/33135970-8bc4-4fb2-ab87-08726a432ce4-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm/extracted-outputs/33135970-8bc4-4fb2-ab87-08726a432ce4-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now, calculate the value of the cut:\n"
msgstr "Sekarang, kira nilai potongan tersebut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a graph this small, the true optimum is easy to brute-force, so you can double-check the results by comparing the QAOA result against the exact answer.\n"
msgstr "Untuk graf sekecil ini, optimum sebenar mudah dicari secara kekerasan, jadi anda boleh menyemak semula keputusan dengan membandingkan keputusan QAOA terhadap jawapan tepat.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Large-scale hardware example {#large-scale-hardware-example}"
msgstr "Contoh perkakasan skala besar {#large-scale-hardware-example}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You have access to many devices with over 100 qubits on IBM Quantum Platform. Select one on which to solve max-cut on a 100-node weighted graph. This is a \"utility-scale\" problem. The workflow follows the same steps as above, applied to a much larger graph.\n"
msgstr "Anda mempunyai akses kepada banyak peranti dengan lebih daripada 100 qubit pada IBM Quantum Platform. Pilih salah satu untuk menyelesaikan max-cut pada graf berwajaran 100 nod. Ini ialah masalah \"skala utiliti\". Aliran kerja mengikut langkah yang sama seperti di atas, digunakan pada graf yang jauh lebih besar.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "End-to-end workflow at utility scale {#end-to-end-workflow-at-utility-scale}"
msgstr "Aliran kerja hujung-ke-hujung pada skala utiliti {#end-to-end-workflow-at-utility-scale}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "All four steps are shown below, applied to the 100-node graph. The structure is the same as the small-scale walkthrough: map, transpile, execute, post-process &mdash; but with a larger problem and split across the four cells below for clarity.\n"
msgstr "Keempat-empat langkah ditunjukkan di bawah, digunakan pada graf 100 nod. Strukturnya sama seperti penelusuran skala kecil: petakan, transpilkan, laksanakan, pasca-proses &mdash; tetapi dengan masalah yang lebih besar dan dipecahkan kepada empat sel di bawah untuk kejelasan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 1**: Build the graph, cost Hamiltonian, and ansatz.\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 1**: Bina graf, Hamiltonian kos, dan ansatz.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 2**: Transpile for the selected hardware backend.\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 2**: Transpilkan untuk Backend perkakasan yang dipilih.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 3**: Run the QAOA optimization loop inside a session, then sample.\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 3**: Jalankan gelung pengoptimuman QAOA dalam sesi, kemudian ambil sampel.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 4**: Post-process the sampled distribution to extract the best cut.\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 4**: Pasca-proses taburan yang disampel untuk mengekstrak potongan terbaik.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that the cost minimized in the optimization loop has converged, and visualize results.\n"
msgstr "Semak bahawa kos yang diminimumkan dalam gelung pengoptimuman telah menumpu, dan visualkan keputusan.\n"

